    "about": "Pinned verb table for autofix/verbs.sh (np_verb). URL and SHA-256 facts are taken from winetricks (LGPL-2.1) and cross-checked where another source exists. A file whose sha256 is null or that is marked unverified is never downloaded: the verb refuses to run.",
