    "checked": "2026-10-09; sizes from HTTP Content-Length (HEAD requests), openal-soft from the GitHub release API digest",
    "paths": "file/find paths are relative to $WINEPREFIX; cache paths are relative to $NOTPROTON_CACHE (default ~/Library/Application Support/notproton/cache). The prefix is always win64: system32 holds 64-bit DLLs, syswow64 32-bit ones.",
    "checks": "installed: every entry must pass. {file, native}: file exists (and is not a Wine builtin/placeholder DLL when native is true). {find, name, ipath, maxdepth}: a match exists. {cache}: file exists in the cache. {any: [...]}: one of the nested checks passes."
